    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leucochrȳsos</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκόχρυσος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A precious stone, a species of chrysolite</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				37, 9, 44, § 128</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A white precious stone, clear as crystal</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				10, 62, § 172</span></i>.</div>
